# delulu-church

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Do not treat `CLAUDE.md` as the spec.

- Angular 22 SPA, `pnpm@11.22.0`, aliases `@core/*` `@features/*` `@shared/*`, selector `ngKitty`
- UI talks only to a **facade**. Feature facades/HTTP services: `@Service({ autoProvided: false })` on the **routed component** `providers` — not `providedIn: 'root'`, not `app.routes.ts`
- `ConfessService` / `CandlesService` stay in `core/`. Domain must not import `@core/ui`
- Errors in feature facades: `HotToastService` + Transloco. New user-facing strings go in `public/i18n/`
- Commits: Conventional Commits, header ≤72. Branches: `feat|fix|chore|docs|style|refactor|perf/<name>_<name>`
- PRs against `main`. Before done: `pnpm typecheck && pnpm lint && pnpm test`
- Do not `--no-verify` hooks. On pnpm 11 use `pnpm run ci` for install, not bare `pnpm ci`
